  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2604.03 Application for Exception Permit, Form DSSP 267. Each applicant for an exception permit shall complete and submit the application form, DSSP 267, “Application for Exception Permit”, effective July, 2014.\n\nSource. #5752, eff 12-2-93; ss by INTERIM #7140, eff 12-2-99, EXPIRED: 3-31-00\n\nNew. #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15",
